        "reason": "A part-to-whole ring, as the description says, with its total in the centre where asked: drawn by the chart library (MUI X Charts, fl_chart; decision), in SOLAR's chart theme, which takes its segments' colours (01 to 08 in order, as drawn), its hole (Figma's arc, 0.6 of the radius) and its centre's text styles from here. What Figma draws is a sample breakdown."
